Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; ============================================================================
;  Removes the "Compress + OCR this folder (in place)" folder context menu
;  installed by compress-folder-context-menu.reg.
;
;  The leading "-" on the key name means DELETE THAT KEY AND EVERYTHING UNDER
;  IT. Only this one verb is removed -- other folder entries, including
;  "Combine PDF", are untouched. No files are affected.
; ============================================================================

[-HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\Directory\shell\CompressPDFFolder]
